<p>
Hi everyone,
</p>

<p>
<b>opam 2.6.1</b> is now available.
</p>

<p>
This release *fix*es a *regr*ession from 2.6.0 where <code>opam install --d=
eps-only</code> would *not inst*all the <code>depexts</code> field from the=
 *pack*ages being *reque*sted.
</p>

<p>
It also <b>impr*oves handling of Git repositories in things like *docker</b=
> containers and works around a <b>bug</b> in Git-for-Windows 2.56.0.window=
s.1 (e.g. shipped by <b>GitHub Actions</b>)
</p>

<p>
:open_book: You can read our <a href=3D"https://opam.ocaml.org/blog/opam-2-=
6-1/">blog post</a> for relevant <b>links</b> and <b>details</b>.
</p>
</div>
<div id=3D"outline-container-org7803abb" class=3D"outline-4">
